					"documentation": "# Create Sale Flow of events\n\n## Basic Flow\n\n1. *Not Register* inserts the **name**, **abizena1**, **abizena2**, **email**, **telefonoa** and **pasahaitza**.\n2. *System* erregistroa egiten du.\n\n\n## Alternative flow (Sale is not created)\n1. Some fields are empty. System informs the *Not Register*.\n2. **pasahaitza** bigarren aldiz sartuta ez du kontziditzen. System informs the *Not Register*.\n3. **email** ereegistratuta dago. System informs the *Not Register*.\n4. *System* ez du erregistroa egiten.",
